Vendored third-party rules
==========================

The rule files below this directory (c/lang/**/*.yaml) are copied verbatim, unmodified, from

  https://github.com/opengrep/opengrep-rules
  commit f1d2b562b414783763fd02a6ed2736eaed622efa

They are the 16 C rules of that repository (c/lang/correctness and c/lang/security). The upstream
test sources (*.c) are not vendored.

